# sdlc_release_gate disaster policies: deploy before security review, or twice.
[sequence]
id: SAFE1
description: security review must pass before deploy
before: SecurityReviewer -> ArchReviewer : ToArch
after: Merger -> DevOps : Deploy

[aggregate]
id: SAFE2
description: deploy at most once
count: Merger -> DevOps : Deploy
max: 1
